=3Drefs/heads/live README (2012-Aug-30), one needs special versions of the =
lttng-tools and babeltrace packages in order to experiment with the live lt=
tngtop alpha/beta.  For technical reasons, I can't use git: directly and us=
ually just fetch tarballs from the http: version instead.

But in this case http://git.dorsal.polymtl.ca/~jdesfossez/lttng-tools gets =
me nowhere (the browser never finishes loading the page (IE), or gives up w=
ith a warning (Firefox)), http://git.dorsal.polymtl.ca has no lttng-tools b=
ranch, and the http://git.lttng.org lttng-tools repository has no live head.

Likewise for babeltrace: http://git.dorsal.polymtl.ca/~jdesfossez/babeltrac=
e is unreachable, http://git.dorsal.polymtl.ca has no babeltrace branch, an=
d the http://git.efficios.com babeltrace repository has no live head.

Where can the live lttngtop versions of lttng-tools and babeltrace be found?

